[
    "ExpertFlow optimizes Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) inference performance through three synergistic components: the Routing Path Predictor, the Token Scheduler, and the Predictive Expert Cache Engine.",
    "Each of these components plays a crucial role in enhancing the efficiency and effectiveness of MoE models, especially in memory-constrained environments.",
    "The Routing Path Predictor is a transformer-based system that estimates expert usage across all MoE layers in a single forward pass.",
    "The Routing Path Predictor accurately predicts which experts will be needed for a given input.",
    "This prediction facilitates early planning for expert activation, improving overall system efficiency.",
    "The Token Scheduler groups tokens with similar predicted routes to enhance expert utilization.",
    "By scheduling tokens with similar routes, the system minimizes the number of expert activations required.",
    "Minimizing expert activations leads to reduced memory usage and improved throughput.",
    "The Predictive Expert Cache Engine loads only the required experts based on predictions made by the Routing Path Predictor.",
    "The Predictive Expert Cache Engine corrects any mispredictions at runtime to maintain system responsiveness and efficiency.",
    "This targeted loading mechanism significantly reduces the GPU memory footprint, achieving up to 93.72% peak memory reduction.",
    "Together, these components enable ExpertFlow to achieve inference throughput up to 10 times faster than strong offloading baselines.",
    "ExpertFlow addresses GPU memory constraints in deploying MoE models.",
    "The integration of the Routing Path Predictor, Token Scheduler, and Predictive Expert Cache Engine allows ExpertFlow to optimize MoE inference performance.",
    "ExpertFlow enhances expert utilization, reduces memory consumption, and improves overall throughput.",
    "ExpertFlow is positioned as a foundational system for scalable sparse model deployment and training."
] 

