    "PaiChecker employs a multi-agent framework operating in three phases: Phase I identifies specific misalignments through three subagents (Issue Analyzer, PR Scope Analyzer, PR Connection Analyzer) targeting patterns such as Incomplete Specification (IS), PR Scope Creep (SC), Unspecified Literal (UL), Defective PR (DP), and Follow-up PR (FP) (arXiv:2607.28587v1).",
