    "PaiChecker distinguishes itself from SWE-bench Verified through its systematic, multi-phase approach leveraging automated agents and code validation to enhance reliability and accuracy in detecting, categorizing, and validating PR-Issue misalignments (arXiv:2607.28587v1).",
    "SWE-bench Verified relies on human validation and qualitative analysis, which may not capture the full complexity of misalignments as effectively as PaiChecker's automated approach (arXiv:2607.28587v1)."
